1
00:00:00,150 --> 00:00:03,503
Dengue mosquitoes are born… very close to us.

2
00:00:04,253 --> 00:00:06,906
In still, clean water around our homes.

3
00:00:07,656 --> 00:00:10,442
Let's find them, and destroy them. Together.

4
00:00:11,050 --> 00:00:13,912
Open DengueWatch BD in your phone's browser.

5
00:00:14,412 --> 00:00:16,823
No app to download. No sign up.

6
00:00:17,450 --> 00:00:18,664
Tap the red button.

7
00:00:19,164 --> 00:00:21,149
Take a photo of the standing water.

8
00:00:21,649 --> 00:00:23,643
Your phone checks the photo for you.

9
00:00:24,250 --> 00:00:27,213
Now, move the map… so the pin sits on the right spot.

10
00:00:27,817 --> 00:00:29,431
Choose the type of container.

11
00:00:29,931 --> 00:00:31,728
Did you see larvae? Tell us.

12
00:00:32,228 --> 00:00:35,541
Then, send it. Faces and number plates are blurred.

13
00:00:36,150 --> 00:00:37,875
Now… become a hunter!

14
00:00:38,225 --> 00:00:41,800
Open the Hunt tab, and see which places near you need cleaning.

15
00:00:42,417 --> 00:00:44,486
Pick a place, and tap the green button.

16
00:00:44,836 --> 00:00:46,782
It is kept for you, for three hours.

17
00:00:47,383 --> 00:00:51,182
Throw out the water. Scrub the inside. Turn it over, or cover it.

18
00:00:51,532 --> 00:00:54,225
Then, standing right there, take the after photo.

19
00:00:54,850 --> 00:00:58,139
You earn points for every place, and climb the leaderboard.

20
00:00:58,489 --> 00:00:59,989
Fake photos are rejected.

21
00:01:00,617 --> 00:01:03,517
Right now… we need volunteers, like you.

22
00:01:04,167 --> 00:01:06,547
Today, look for one place near your home.

